  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Funding Principles for Peace Foundation 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of Principle for Peace Foundation (P4P) is to enhance the quality and sustainability of peace engagement and generate momentum for global new ways to address the challenges of conflict and insecurity. In order to achieve this, P4P will catalyse international, regional, and local efforts to build support and buy-in, institutionalize and monitor the principles and proposed policy shifts towards greater effectiveness of peace-making actions and policy.</narrative>
  </description>
